  "kv1.8:2.7": "atītā vipakkavipākā dhammā ekacce atthī, ekacce natthī’ti. ",
  "kv1.8:2.8": "na hevaṃ vattabbe …pe… ",
  "kv1.8:2.9": "atītaṃ ekaccaṃ atthī, ekaccaṃ natthī’ti. ",
